!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/link-money.tn"
!!meta:"https://tson.io/2026/34/m/meta.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/34/m/core.tn"
@doc:"""
  A fixture schema for the class2/link layer, declaring one type the vectors import.

  Named for what it declares rather than for the vector that uses it: the fixture namespace is shared
  across every vector, so a name like 'alpha' would be claimed by whichever vector got there first and
  would have to be renamed the moment a second wanted a different 'money'.
  """
{
  money => {
    amount: int64
    currency: text
  }
}
